OL,3,GNEWSAVehicle thefts rise to highest
OL,4,Alevel in a decade
OL,5,
OL,6,FVehicle thefts in Devon and Cornwall
OL,7,Fhave risen to their highest level in at
OL,8,Fleast a decade, with police linking the
OL,9,Fincrease to organised criminal gangs
OL,10,Fand increasingly sophisticated theft
OL,11,Ftechniques.
OL,13,FDevon and Cornwall Police recorded
OL,14,F1,550 vehicle theft offences in
OL,15,F2025-26, up 60.8% from 964 in 2015-16
OL,16,Fand up 11.4% from 1,392 in 2024-25,
OL,17,FHome Office data shows.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
