OL,3,GNEWSAVehicle thefts rise to highest
OL,4,Alevel in a decade
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice said organised crime groups were
OL,7,Fresponsible for a significant
OL,8,Fproportion of vehicle thefts, with
OL,9,Foffenders increasingly using technology
OL,10,Fsuch as electronic key cloning to steal
OL,11,Fvehicles.
OL,13,FDespite a recent drop, vehicle thefts
OL,14,Fare up almost 50% in England and Wales
OL,15,Fcompared with a decade ago, according
OL,16,Fto the figures.
